    "id": "ALLIANZ-pds-policy-numbers-that--7",
    "content": "### What we cover if Comprehensive is shown as your chosen cover on your\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Coverage`\n\npolicy details documents.\nAgreed value The cost to replace your car as agreed when you took out the cover or renewed.\nNote: Your car is covered for an agreed value, not market value.\nChoice of repairer We’ll help you find a repairer, or you can choose your own.\nNew car replacement After total loss within 2 years of manufacture.\nRental car\n- After a collision that wasn’t your fault,\n- after theft,\n- after total loss.\nLegal liability Damage you cause to other peoples’ cars or property, for up to $20M.\nAccidental loss or damage to your car Including theft.\nGuarantee On repairs we authorise.\nEmergency repairs Up to $500 per incident.\nLegal costs Reasonable costs.\nTowing and storage Reasonable costs.\nTransport Up to $500 per incident.\nEmergency accommodation Up to $500 per incident.\nKey replacement and lock recoding After theft, up to $1,000 per period of insurance.\nBaby capsules and car seats Up to $650 per seat, per incident.\nPersonal belongings Up to $1,000 per incident.\nYour Cover 16 Temporary insurance On your replacement car, up to 14 days.\nDisability modifications Up to your agreed value.\nThis is a summary only. For the complete list of exclusions and their full terms and conditions see page 42.\nDriver exclusions You won’t be covered if the driver:\n- is unlicensed to drive or isn’t following the conditions of their licence\n- exceeds the legal limit of alcohol in their blood or breath or is under the influence of any drugs\n- refuses a drugs or alcohol test\n- is excluded under an age limit shown on your policy details document Car exclusions You won’t be covered if:\nUsage exclusions You won’t be covered if:\n- your car isn’t registered in a state or territory\n- the car is unroadworthy\n- you fail to keep your car safe",
