    "content": "### excess of 90 consecutive days, We will not pay for\n\n**Clause Classification:** `SubLimit`\n\nloss or damage to property to:\n(i) Section Two – Farm Property; or (ii) Section Five – Engineering;\nunless You have Our prior agreement in writing.\nCover may be extended, provided that You pay an additional premium required by Us.\nThis Situation left unattended exclusion will not apply to Section One – Home Property or Section Two – Farm Property if the loss or damage results from:\n(i) lightning;\n(ii) thunderbolt;\n(iii) riot and civil commotion;\n(iv) damage directly caused by impact by a vehicle;\n(v) waterborne craft;\n(vi) space debris, aircraft, rocket, satellite, a branch; or\n(vii) Tsunami or earthquake.\n9. Bushﬁre / Grassﬁre This Policy does not cover loss or damage which is caused by, arises from, or is any way connected with bushﬁre or grassﬁre within 72 hours after You ﬁrst take out or increase Your cover under Your Policy. This exclusion period does not apply to renewals or if this insurance commences directly after:\na) another insurance policy covering the same Property Insured expired, without a break in cover;\nb) You have entered into a contract of sale to purchase the Property Insured;\nc) You have entered into a contract to lease the Property Insured; or\n(iii) Any pandemic or epidemic, as declared as such by the World Health Organisation.\n11. Coal Seam Gas This Policy does not cover loss or damage caused by or arising from the fracking, extraction, exploration, production, installation, removal or any other activities related to manufacture and/or distribution of coal seam gas at Your Situation.\n\n> ⚠️ **Mandatory Embargo Window:** A strict **72-hour embargo** applies post-purchase. No cover for losses occurring within 72 hours of policy inception unless transferring without lapse.",
