    "content": "### Definitions — Loss or damage\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Loss or damage** means physical loss or physical damage.\nMarket value the amount that the market would pay for the car (or hire car). The market value of the car (or hire car) includes many factors such as age, make, model, kilometres travelled and general condition of the car (or hire car). We may use recognised industry publications to assist us in calculating the amount. Market value excludes costs of registration, compulsory third party/ motor accident injuries insurance, stamp duty and transfer fees, dealer warranty costs and dealer delivery.\nModifications see page 18.",
