    "content": "### Definitions — Your insurance schedule\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Your insurance schedule** means your latest insurance schedule we have given you. It is an important document that sets out the information you’ve given us, on which we’ve based our decision to insure you, as well as the individual details of your policy. We’ll send you an updated insurance schedule whenever you let us know these details have changed.",
