    "id": "CHALLENGER-pds-guaranteed-annuity-f-6",
    "content": "### excess investment\n\n**Clause Classification:** `SubLimit`\n\nreturn (this is how we make money), or we add more of our money so we can always meet our promise to you Product features Snapshot\n- Operates in a similar way to a term deposit available from a bank3.\n- You can only use your personal (non-superannuation) savings to invest.\n- You choose the fixed term of between 1 year and 5 years.\n- You have the choice of monthly or yearly payments.\n- Your investment is repaid at the end of the fixed term.\n- Payments are guaranteed regardless of how investment markets perform.\nWho can invest? The summary The detail Anyone aged 18 years and older.\n- The minimum investment is $10,000.\n- You can invest jointly with another person.\n- A self-managed superannuation fund (SMSF) can invest.\n- You should consider the Fixed Term Annuity Target Market Determination\n(TMD) before making a decision about whether to invest. A copy of the TMD can be obtained by calling us or online (see back cover).\nWhat terms are available? You can choose an investment term of 1 to 5 years.\nThe term you select must be a whole year and cannot change after you invest.\nHow often will I be paid? You can choose to receive payments monthly or yearly.\nYour regular payments will be paid by electronic transfer to your bank, building society or credit union account at the end of the payment frequency you have chosen. For example, if you choose to be paid monthly, the first payment will be made one month after investing. If you choose to be paid yearly, the first payment will be made one year after investing. If you invest for a 1-year fixed term, you cannot choose to receive yearly payments.\nOnce your Annuity starts, you cannot change your choice.\nWhat interest rate will I receive? We offer competitive rates based on current investment market conditions.",
