    "content": "### Definitions — Elective surgery\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Elective surgery** means cosmetic surgery to alter or improve your appearance unless recommended by a medical practitioner to improve your physical health related to an underlying sickness or injury.\nThis contractual definition applies across all insured events, policy schedules, and general exclusions unless specified otherwise on your Certificate of Insurance.",
