    "content": "### Definitions — Named cyclone\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Named cyclone** means the Australian Bureau of Meteorology (or equivalent body) has issued a cyclone warning and those cyclonic conditions have been given a name.\nOn-site for On-site only cover, means your caravan is located at the address shown on your certificate of insurance.\n\n> ⚠️ **Mandatory Embargo Window:** A strict **72-hour embargo** applies post-purchase. No cover for losses occurring within 72 hours of policy inception unless transferring without lapse.",
