    "content": "### excess applies to claims under each section and\n\n**Clause Classification:** `SubLimit`\n\nshould be read with your Insurance certificate.\nAll benefits are applicable to individual, couple and family cover. The sums insured set out below are the maximum amount we will pay under each section per insured person per trip.\nPlease refer to the applicable sections of the Policy Wording, along with the General conditions and General exclusions.\nInternational Annual Multi-Trip Benefit Bare Essentials Sum Insured Silver Sum Insured Gold Sum Insured Excess* Gold Sum Insured Excess* Additional emergency expenses $5,000 $15,000 $50,000 Yes C2 Resumption of journey Nil Nil $3,000 Yes D Travel delay expenses Nil E1 Personal belongings and baggage $5,000 $7,500 $8,000 Up to $50 per Up to $100 per completed 12 hours completed 12 hours up to $1,000 up to $2,000 Nil $2,000 $3,000 valuables Nil $500 $750 single article limit/pair or set of items limit $500 $500 $750 No Yes E2 Additional specified items cover Nil Upgrade Upgrade Yes E3 Delayed baggage Nil $500 $750 No Including sub-limit for delays between 8-24 hours Nil Nil $200 Including sub-limit for delays after 24 hours Nil $500 $500 E4 Passport and travel documents Nil $2,500 $5,000 No E5 Money Nil $250 $500 Yes F Accidental death and permanent disability Nil $37,500 $50,000 No G Personal liability $1,500,000 $2,500,000 $5,000,000 Yes H Legal expenses Nil $10,000 $25,000 Yes A Cancelling your trip $10,000 $15,000 Unlimited Yes I Airline hijack Nil Nil $2,500 No B1 Medical and other expenses outside Australia Unlimited Unlimited Unlimited Yes J Pet care Nil Nil $600 No Emergency overseas medical treatment Unlimited Unlimited Unlimited K Rental car excess waiver Nil $4,000 $4,000 No L Loss of income Nil $5,200 $10,400 No $500 $500 $500 M1 COVID-19 Expenses:",
