    "id": "INSUREANDGO-pds-cruise-7",
    "content": "### Important Information\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Coverage`\n\nTo have cover for any policy upgrade you must have purchased the upgrade and it must be shown on your Certificate of Insurance.\nSum Insured Excess* $1,250 Yes $600 $50 per 24 hours up to $500 No Lift pass $500 Yes N4 Ski pack $150 per 24 hours up to $600 No N5 Piste closure $50 per 24 hours up to $500 No N6 Avalanche cover $600 Yes Additional Specified Items Cover Provides additional item/set limit for specified items - available on Silver and Gold policies only.\nBenefit E2 Specified items Single article, Pair or Set limit Silver and Gold Excess* $4,000 for a single item up to $8,000 for combined items Yes *Excess If your claim is paid, this excess is deducted from any payment we make to you. An excess is applied per insured person and if multiple events occur during a trip an excess will be applied for each event per insured person.\nInsure&Go Travel Insurance | Cruise | Product Disclosure Statement\nCONTENTS | TABLE OF BENEFITS | POLICY UPGRADES | GENERAL INFORMATION | GENERAL DEFINITIONS | BENEFITS | GENERAL EXCLUSIONS Business Cover In addition to the standard policy benefits you will be covered for benefits Section O – Business cover.\nBenefit O1 Business equipment Excess* $2,500 Yes Single article, Pair or Set of items limit $1,000 Business samples $1,000 O2 Emergency courier expenses O3 Business equipment hire O4 O5 Sum Insured $500 Yes $100 per 24 hours up to $1,000 No Business money $1,000 Yes Cash limit $500 Replacing staff $5,000 No Cruise Cover This upgrade is included on all Insure&Go Travel Insurance Cruise policies, in addition to the standard benefits, you will also have cover for the benefits under Section P – Cruise up to the limits shown in the table of benefits below.",
