    "id": "NOBLEOAK-pds-fiftyup-life-25",
    "content": "### Definitions — Survival Period\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Survival Period** means a period of at least 14 days that the Life Insured must survive after a Trauma Event without the aid of an artificial life support system.\nIndexation increases stop at age 65 for Life and TPD Insurance, and age 60 for Trauma Insurance and Income Protection Insurance. Your premium will automatically adjust to reflect the increase in cover. You may cancel these automatic increases by writing to us.\nTrustee Member Injury",
