    "content": "### Excess\n\n**Clause Classification:** `SubLimit`\n\napplies? (Single Trip or Annual Multi-Trip) (Single Trip) Overseas medical expenses (including emergency repatriation/evacuation) Yes $Unlimited# $10,000,000# Overseas emergency dental expenses Yes $2,000 Following is a table of the benefits and their maximum limits. Please refer to the Policy wording on pages 19-42 for full details on the cover provided.\nImportantly, please note that conditions, exclusions, limits and sub-limits apply.\nPolicy benefits 1* Overseas medical and dental expenses (including emergency repatriation/evacuation) $2,000 Included above with overseas 2* Additional expenses Yes $Unlimited~ 3* Amendment or cancellation costs Yes Cover chosen Cover chosen§ 4* Luggage and personal effects $12,000 $5,000 medical expenses limit~ § Phone - limit per item• $1,000 $1,000 Camera or video camera - limit per item• $4,000 $3,500 Laptop computer - limit per item• $3,000 $3,000 Tablet computer - limit per item• $3,000 $3,000 $1,000 $1,000 $1,000 $1,000 $1,000 $1,000 $1,000 $1,000 Drone (with or without camera) - limit per item• Artificial limb, removable dental appliance, dentures or medical Yes device e.g. hearing aids, CPAP machine - limit per item• Jewellery - limit per item• Watch or any other item - limit per item• 5* Travel documents Yes $12,000 $3,000 6* Delayed luggage allowance Yes $1,100 $600 Money No $200\n- Rental Car insurance excess No $10,000 $5,000 9* Travel delay No $2,000\n- Resumption of Journey Yes $3,000\n- Special events Yes $2,000\n- 12* Hospital incidentals No $8,000 $1,000 13* Hijacking No $8,000 14* Loss of income 15* $2,000 No ^ $45,000\n- Disability No $30,000\n- 16* Accidental death No $30,000 Personal liability No $2,500,000 COVID-19 benefits Yes - as applicable #\u0007Cover will not exceed 12 months from the onset of the illness or injury.",
