    "id": "NRMA-pds-caravan-2",
    "content": "### Definitions — Agreed Value\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Agreed Value** means the amount We agree to insure Your Vehicle for that is shown on Your Certificate of Insurance. It includes:\n- CDs, DVDs, tapes, records, game cartridges or discs of any sort;\n- any Modifications, options, Accessories, Annexe or Fixtures and Fittings to Your Vehicle;\n- curios, furs, works of art or items containing gold or silver;\n- GST;\n- jewellery or watches;\n- registration and any compulsory third party insurance; and\n- mobile phones, pagers, electronic organisers or GPS navigation units;\n- other on-road costs.\n- computers, their software or equipment or any files stored on a computer;\n- goods kept for sale, distribution, on display, exhibition or on consignment;\n- animals;\n- any illegal items, including illegal firearms or illegally stored firearms;\n- bicycles, tricycles, or scooters;\n- bonds or negotiable instruments;\n- cameras or video cameras or their equipment or accessories;\n- cash, coins, banknotes, or medals;\n- credit cards or financial transaction cards;\n- deeds, documents or manuscripts;\n- surfing, sail-boarding, waterskiing, skiing or diving equipment or any accessories of such;\n- fittings;\nContents does not include:\nIt does not include any:\n- allowance for dealer profit;\n- warranty costs;\n- stamp duty; or\n- transfer fees.",
