    "id": "NRMA-pds-travel-9",
    "content": "### Definitions — Yourself\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Yourself** means the people listed as adults on the Certificate of Insurance and includes Accompanied Children except on the Domestic Cancellation Plan in which case cover applies on a per person basis only. Where more than one person is listed as an adult on the Certificate of Insurance all benefits, limitations, conditions and exclusions will be interpreted as if a separate policy was issued to each of the persons listed as an adult other than:\na. in the event a claim arising from the one event is made, an excess (if applicable) will only be applied once;\nComputer",
