    "id": "YOUI-pds-caravan-trailer-19",
    "content": "### Definitions — Total loss\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Total loss** means when the caravan or trailer is either stolen and not recovered, or it is damaged to the extent it is not economical or safe to repair; for example, where the combined repair costs and salvage value are likely to be more than the market value or any other value we are required to use by law, or where the caravan or trailer is a statutory write off as required by law.",
