    "id": "ZURICH-pds-ezicover-income-prot-35",
    "content": "### Definitions — Waiting period\n\n**Clause Classification:** `Definition`\n\n**Waiting period** means the period of time you must wait and be totally disabled before being eligible for a benefit. The waiting period begins when both of the following occur:\n- you are totally disabled,\n- you have consulted a medical practitioner about your total disability.\nThis page has been left blank intentionally.\nGeneral Conditions Zurich Australia Limited ABN 92 000 010 195 AFSL 232510 Locked Bag 994 North Sydney NSW 2059 Telephone: 1800 025 015 zurich.com.au/ezicover ZCUR-023128-2025 662056_ZAL540561-0625",
